  "label": "Buddhist monks are mapped as the 'peaceful religion' being defended",
  "description": "The text 'how dare people make fun of our peaceful religion' explicitly maps the visual entity 'Buddhist_monks' onto the abstract concept of 'peaceful religion'. The monks, as the visual representation of Buddhism, are being framed by the text as the embodiment of a sacred, peaceful institution that must be protected from mockery. This is an analogical mapping where the visual group is equated with the textual concept they represent.",
